{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>SABOTAGE THE RACE. RIG THE ODDS. WIN BIG.</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a robot run post-apocalyptic casino in the middle of the desert, you and your friends bet on chaotic horse races: without rules.  Juice up the horses, fling them off the track, or even steal your friends' bets. All that matters is that you win: or your rivals lose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631410/extras/e5a8c3d61f01ca3ba3eb364b0a3436ee.poster.avif?t=1756777442\" width=480 height=152 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631410/extras/e5a8c3d61f01ca3ba3eb364b0a3436ee.webm?t=1756777442\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631410/extras/e5a8c3d61f01ca3ba3eb364b0a3436ee.mp4?t=1756777442\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>GAMBLE TO WIN</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your money by choosing what horses to bet on every race. Bet on horses winning, losing, placing, over/under times, and more. Find out what your friends are betting on, and team up for a shared objective. Or steal their bets for yourself. Whatever type of gambler you want to be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631410/extras/bbbcda09778a231524aadd0ac56656e9.poster.avif?t=1756777442\" width=480 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631410/extras/bbbcda09778a231524aadd0ac56656e9.webm?t=1756777442\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631410/extras/bbbcda09778a231524aadd0ac56656e9.mp4?t=1756777442\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>CHAOTIC RACING</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 different race tracks and a different weather condition every race. Meteor showers, lightning storms, tornados, or even low gravity: all things that may make or break what happens to your favorite horse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631410/extras/757b74d61d1666e49e6dc4db9a8e1d6b.poster.avif?t=1756777442\" width=480 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631410/extras/757b74d61d1666e49e6dc4db9a8e1d6b.webm?t=1756777442\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631410/extras/757b74d61d1666e49e6dc4db9a8e1d6b.mp4?t=1756777442\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>45+ ITEMS</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different items are available for sale every race, providing different strategies to win. Horse steroids, upgraded robot parts, spring loaded sneakers, rockets, explosives, bet-stealing items, catapults, bomb vests, electric mines, and more: all types of sabotage - if you can afford it. Increase your own horse's chance of winning: or decrease your opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631410/extras/2e6046c6bc47b63f6cfbd91168ebba1a.poster.avif?t=1756777442\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631410/extras/2e6046c6bc47b63f6cfbd91168ebba1a.webm?t=1756777442\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631410/extras/2e6046c6bc47b63f6cfbd91168ebba1a.mp4?t=1756777442\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>MULTIPLE GAMEMODES</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with passive competition, where whoever makes the most money across 9 races wins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or play more aggressively: with quota-style elimination at the end of each day, until only one player remains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gamble solo, or with 2-4 players online.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3631410?t=1756777442","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631410/9f79c4dd4d7a23147c1f2c31b3e96a7a3fd0c9c8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756777442","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631410/20d2ebc151ad6407531e3e56e2526c68e9e04b21/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756777442","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631410/20d2ebc151ad6407531e3e56e2526c68e9e04b21/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756777442","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The basis of the game is gambling and it involves parody drug and weapon use, such as dynamite to blow up robots and alcohol that makes you fall over or see special effects."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>SABOTAGE THE RACE. RIG THE ODDS. WIN BIG.</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a robot run post-apocalyptic casino in the middle of the desert, you and your friends bet on chaotic horse races: without rules.  Juice up the horses, fling them off the track, or even steal your friends' bets. All that matters is that you win: or your rivals lose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631410/extras/e5a8c3d61f01ca3ba3eb364b0a3436ee.poster.avif?t=1756777442\" width=480 height=152 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631410/extras/e5a8c3d61f01ca3ba3eb364b0a3436ee.webm?t=1756777442\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631410/extras/e5a8c3d61f01ca3ba3eb364b0a3436ee.mp4?t=1756777442\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>GAMBLE TO WIN</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your money by choosing what horses to bet on every race. Bet on horses winning, losing, placing, over/under times, and more. Find out what your friends are betting on, and team up for a shared objective. Or steal their bets for yourself. Whatever type of gambler you want to be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631410/extras/bbbcda09778a231524aadd0ac56656e9.poster.avif?t=1756777442\" width=480 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631410/extras/bbbcda09778a231524aadd0ac56656e9.webm?t=1756777442\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631410/extras/bbbcda09778a231524aadd0ac56656e9.mp4?t=1756777442\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>CHAOTIC RACING</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 different race tracks and a different weather condition every race. Meteor showers, lightning storms, tornados, or even low gravity: all things that may make or break what happens to your favorite horse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631410/extras/757b74d61d1666e49e6dc4db9a8e1d6b.poster.avif?t=1756777442\" width=480 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631410/extras/757b74d61d1666e49e6dc4db9a8e1d6b.webm?t=1756777442\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631410/extras/757b74d61d1666e49e6dc4db9a8e1d6b.mp4?t=1756777442\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>45+ ITEMS</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different items are available for sale every race, providing different strategies to win. Horse steroids, upgraded robot parts, spring loaded sneakers, rockets, explosives, bet-stealing items, catapults, bomb vests, electric mines, and more: all types of sabotage - if you can afford it. Increase your own horse's chance of winning: or decrease your opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631410/extras/2e6046c6bc47b63f6cfbd91168ebba1a.poster.avif?t=1756777442\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631410/extras/2e6046c6bc47b63f6cfbd91168ebba1a.webm?t=1756777442\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631410/extras/2e6046c6bc47b63f6cfbd91168ebba1a.mp4?t=1756777442\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>MULTIPLE GAMEMODES</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with passive competition, where whoever makes the most money across 9 races wins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or play more aggressively: with quota-style elimination at the end of each day, until only one player remains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gamble solo, or with 2-4 players online.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Jake"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631410/b43a69e2521e6842b066d8dd751a38f430009c15/header.jpg?t=1756777442","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257188033,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257188033/movie480.mp4?t=1756393791","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257188033/movie_max.mp4?t=1756393791"},"name":"Trailer 1","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257188033/e741939c623e79e6a7b80b2a07ac97b57fff4c5d/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1756393791","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257188033/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1756393791","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257188033/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1756393791"}}],"name":"AUTO DERBY CASINO","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-2100 / AMD FX-6300<br></li><li